5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know how this affects our actual time! I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor and the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'm interested in the financial side. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should be fair about the layout. I'll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is key for me. I'll investigate the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
